<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">HEHU CARE · 禾护</view><view class="title">{{title}}</view><view class="sub">让每一次记录，成为成长的照护。<view>手机验证 → 选择孩子 → 填写并提交</view></view><view wx:if="{{invalid}}" class="notice">问卷入口无效，请向医护人员获取正确的小程序码。</view><view wx:else class="card"><view class="field"><text class="label">监护人手机号</text><input type="number" maxlength="11" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="input" data-key="phone"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">短信验证码</text><view class="row"><input class="grow" type="number" maxlength="6" value="{{code}}" bindinput="input" data-key="code"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="sendCode" disabled="{{sending || countdown > 0}}">{{countdown > 0 ? countdown + '秒' : '获取验证码'}}</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{devCode}}" class="notice">开发验证码：{{devCode}}<view>未发送真实短信，仅用于演示。</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="login" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">验证并进入</button></view><view class="small">开发版请使用演示资料。手机号登录用于关联监护人账号，不等同于微信一键获取手机号。当前不提供实时医疗值守。</view></view>
